 "text": "How To Start An AI Agency\nFREE Live Training Event\nSAVE YOUR SEAT NOW\nHow To Start And Scale An AI Agency\nI'll Show You How To Find Clients, What Services You Should Be Selling To These Businesses, And How To Close The Deal\nThis Training is FREE and we go Live On: Saturday, October 31st @ 12:00 PM EST\nReserve My Seat Now!\nLimited Spots Are Available\nInside This Training, You’ll Learn:\n\nWhat it really takes to start an AI agency, even with no tech skills or experience\n\nWhere the real opportunity in AI is right now, and how to get started.\n\nThe simplest path to landing your first client (most people overcomplicate this)\n\nHow to position your services so you stand out in a crowded market\n\nThe 4 AI services that are scaling right now.\n\nHow to get clients coming to you instead of chasing them\n\nThe common mistakes to avoid during sales calls.\n\nHow to research and choose a niche with room to grow\n\nWhat to focus on first so you're not overwhelmed by all the AI noise\n\nHow to turn a single client into steady, repeat business\n\nNo Technical Knowledge Required To Get Started\nThis Training is FREE and we go Live On:\nSaturday, October 31st @ 12:00 PM EST\nReserve My Seat Now!\nLimited Spots Are Available\nHosted By: Nick Puru\n\nNick Puru\n\nFounder, AI Accelerator (12,000+ Members) | Co-Founder, Reprise AI & Sync2\n\nNick Puru has built two AI agencies from the ground up. One installing AI operating systems inside established businesses, another serving clinics and accounting firms.\n\nHe teaches what he actually runs day-to-day, to a combined audience of 90,000+ on YouTube and 70,000+ on Instagram, where he breaks down how real companies put modern AI to work.\n\nThis isn't theory, It's the playbook he's using right now.\n\nReserve My Seat Now!\nLimited Spots Are Available\nResults Don't Lie\nSee What's Possible Once You Show Up For The Live Masterclass\nReserve My Seat Now!\nLimited Spots Are Available\n\nThe income figures and results mentioned on this page including $10K/month, $5K retainers, and $100K+ in client revenue are real results from specific individuals and are not typical. Your results will vary based on your effort, experience, consistency, and a number of factors outside our control. Many people who attend trainings and join communities see little to no results. We make no guarantee that you will earn any specific income or build a successful business by attending this webinar or applying what you learn.\n\nThis is a free educational training not a business opportunity, franchise offer, or investment vehicle. Nothing shared during this event constitutes legal, financial, or tax advice. Also, this site is not a part of the Facebook website or Facebook Inc. Additionally, This site is NOT endorsed by Facebook in any way. FACEBOOK is a trademark of FACEBOOK, Inc.\n\n© 2026 The AI Accelerators All Rights Reserved\n\nPrivacy Policy | Terms of Service",
